8840: 
8841: 
8842: \medskip
8843: \begin{proof}
8844: The evidence-level definition in
8845: Definition~\ref{def:operational-acceptance-interface} requires a command-run row
8846: to record command, immutable source state, environment, exit code, and log
8847: path; otherwise the boundary field must say that no command-run assertion is
8848: made.  The first six rows of Table~\ref{tab:command-boundary-inventory} contain
8849: all five required command-run fields, read at the source-state level explicitly
8850: stated in each row.  The first log records command
