8852: checkout source state
8853: \path{current local automath checkout plus review_bundle/FINAL_DIGESTS_SHA256.md},
8854: \path{Python 3.10.11 on Windows 10}, exit code \path{0}, and refreshed log path
8855: \path{review_bundle/certificate_verification_run.log}.  Its negative boundary is
